ows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"told\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to run\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ran\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to become\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"became\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to lose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lost\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to fall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to slide\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"slid\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to begin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"began\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "She told me an interesting legend. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It was about an elephant.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The elephant had a great fall.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Past Time Expressions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that happened in the past, you can use a Past time expression.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of Past time expressions: <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Last (night/week/year) <li>This (week/year) <li>Many years/A long time ago <li>When ... was/were <li>Days/Weeks/Months passed <li>From that day/then on</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A long time ago, in a far away place there lived a man ...  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Months passed, and the prince didn't come back. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "From that day on, it started to rain.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to frighten ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make someone or something feel afraid ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The animals frightened her.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a myth.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "proud", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having respect for yourself ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was too proud to leave.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to worry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think a lot about something you are scared about  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was worried about what the queen would do.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "journey ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of time spent travelling from one place to another ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The snake started his long journey across the desert.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to beg ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask for something because you want it very much ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He begged the queen not to take away his powers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to promise ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tell someone that you will do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The snake promised to be kind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to feel sorry for", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to feel pity for someone because they are in a bad situation ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He felt sorry for the lion and helped him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take away", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to remove ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The evil queen took away his powers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pride ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a feeling that you like and respect yourself and that you deserve to be respected by other people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The father was full of pride as his child graduated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Brainstorm some ideas about how you think the snake lost its legs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one idea. Write a short myth. Use the Simple Past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your myth.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give your myth to a partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read their myth.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your myths. What did you like? What was funny? Interesting?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I tell a story.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Simple Past tense. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss with my partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}